  "final_message": "Implemented the weather display app.\n\n- `backend/app.py`: SQLite store under `./data`, seeded with six cities, bearer-token auth, all weather/auth/recent endpoints, validation, paging, case-insensitive uniqueness, and SPA serving.\n- `frontend/`: React + TypeScript UI with Tailwind (v4 via Vite plugin), search card, \u00b0C/\u00b0F switch, recent lookups, auth forms, report CRUD with server validation messages and delete confirmation.\n- Updated `Dockerfile` to correctly install the hashed `requirements.lock`, added `tsconfig.json`, `.gitignore`, and rebuilt successfully.\n\nVerified API flows (register/login, CRUD, lookups, paging, 401s) and `npm run build`/`tsc --noEmit` both pass.",
